+else body=`<div class="scene"><div class="scene-content"><div class="scene-label">MIKA’S SHELTER · LATE NIGHT</div><h3>For now, the world can wait.</h3><p>Lantern light pools on the floorboards. Outside, rain slips from the eaves and the village keeps watch. Mika offers to show you a basic stance, share what they know, or simply let you sleep.</p></div></div><section class="story-block"><h3>How do you spend the last hours of the night?</h3><p>These are quiet choices, but small acts build a life here. You can train and talk once, then rest before the road to the Hidden Leaf.</p><div class="choices"><button class="story-choice" data-act="train"><b>Practice the basics with Mika</b><span>Spend 10 chakra to build resolve and earn experience.</span><em>${state.flags.trained?'COMPLETED':'+10 XP · +1 RESOLVE'}</em></button><button class="story-choice" data-act="talk"><b>Ask Mika about this world</b><span>Listen first. Share a little of your own story if they ask.</span><em>${state.flags.talked?'COMPLETED':'+1 TRUST'}</em></button><button class="story-choice" data-act="rest"><b>Sleep until first light</b><span>Recover vitality and chakra. The road can wait until morning.</span><em>${state.flags.rested?'COMPLETED':'REST'}</em></button><button class="story-choice" data-act="continue"><b>Write down what happened</b><span>Return to the chapter summary and review the choices that brought you here.</span><em>OPEN JOURNAL</em></button></div></section><div class="ending"><div class="eyebrow">A pause, not an ending</div><h3>The next day is waiting.</h3><p>Your choices are saved locally. Follow the journal of your first night, check your status, or return to this quiet moment whenever you’re ready.</p></div>`;
